RATES
DataDriven
-start
# Rate constant read from DATA
10 DATA 0.3
20 RESTORE 10
30 READ k
40 rate = k * M * TIME
50 IF rate > M THEN rate = M
60 SAVE rate
-end
SOLUTION 1
    pH 7
KINETICS 1
    DataDriven
        -formula H2O 0
        -m 1
        -m0 1
        -tol 1e-12
        -steps 0.5 0.5 1.0 seconds
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -kinetics DataDriven
END
